{"id":"n48965-1-7","stage":4,"title":"돌파 · 突破","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48965-1-7-1","ko":"아! 드디어 한 골이 나왔네요!","zh":"啊！终于进了一球呢！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아!","meaning":"哇","explanation":"아：哇","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"2","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드디어","meaning":"终于，到底，总算","explanation":"드디어：终于，到底，总算","readings":[{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15026","senseId":"1","lemma":"드디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"골이","meaning":"球，进球","explanation":"골：球，进球；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"골","audio":"/audio/68a6cf8ed8e09fd6ad87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27718","senseId":"2","lemma":"골","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나왔네요!","meaning":"出现，出来","explanation":"나오다：出现，出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"10","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"哇","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到喜悦、感动时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"dfc77ad537b73519","term":"드디어","zh":"终于，到底，总算","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3","entryId":"15026","definition":"期待已久的最终；到了最后。","pronunciation":["드디어"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"68a6cf8ed8e09fd6","term":"골","zh":"球，进球","audio":"/audio/68a6cf8ed8e09fd6ad87.mp3","entryId":"27718","definition":"足球、篮球、曲棍球、手球等运动中射门得分。又指成功射入的球。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"某个东西被发现或显现。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/31d45f4561eb112d79dd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48965-1-7-2","ko":"네, 박 선수의 측면 돌파가 먹혔어요!","zh":"对，朴选手的侧翼突破很成功！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"박","meaning":"朴（姓氏）","explanation":"박：朴（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"박","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"선수의","meaning":"选手，运动员","explanation":"선수：选手，运动员；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62050","senseId":"1","lemma":"선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"측면","meaning":"侧面","explanation":"측면：侧面","readings":[{"term":"측면","audio":"/audio/89e838f2c339a35ddb7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79019","senseId":"1","lemma":"측면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌파가","meaning":"突破，冲破，攻破","explanation":"돌파：突破，冲破，攻破；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돌파","audio":"/audio/f16160e08a19570663b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48965","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌파","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹혔어요!","meaning":"被理解，被接受","explanation":"먹히다：被理解，被接受；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"먹히다","audio":"/audio/78b7be5f3a01c21e290e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62055","senseId":"2","lemma":"먹히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c4df0bdce9d53b7c","term":"선수","zh":"选手，运动员","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3","entryId":"62050","definition":"体育比赛中被选为代表的人；或指以运动为职业的人。","pronunciation":["선ː수"]},{"id":"89e838f2c339a35d","term":"측면","zh":"侧面","audio":"/audio/89e838f2c339a35ddb7b.mp3","entryId":"79019","definition":"以前后为准，左侧或右侧一面。","pronunciation":["층면"]},{"id":"f16160e08a195706","term":"돌파","zh":"突破，冲破，攻破","audio":"/audio/f16160e08a19570663b6.mp3","entryId":"48965","definition":"闯过敌阵或对方的防守进入。","pronunciation":["돌파"]},{"id":"78b7be5f3a01c21e","term":"먹히다","zh":"被理解，被接受","audio":"/audio/78b7be5f3a01c21e290e.mp3","entryId":"62055","definition":"某话语或行动被对方理解或接受。","pronunciation":["머키다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4ef8fcf50542addef6aa.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.79,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=48965","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":134,"sequenceScore":2.6167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对，朴选手的侧翼突破很成功！","啊！终于进了一球呢！","这次比赛的冠军奖金是多少呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["啊！终于进了一球呢！","这次比赛的冠军奖金是多少呢？","对，朴选手的侧翼突破很成功！"],"answer":2}]}
